WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:06.210
So which dolphin do you like, Hii-chan?

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.440
Hii-chan loves every dolphin!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.740
I love them!

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.480
<b>Bottlenose Dolphin</b>

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.830
They're cute!

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:16.440
<b>Commerson's Dolphin</b>

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.220
They're so cool!

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:18.400
<b>Southern Right Whale Dolphin</b>

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:22.940
Dreamy!

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:24.480
No way!

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:36.460
<b>Muromi-san on the Shore</b>

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:36.460
<b>Episode 3
"Muromi-san and Old Memories"</b>

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.190
A wonderful big jump!

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:11.840
Thank you for coming to 
our dolphin show today!

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.770
Come and watch us again!

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:15.610
Gimme fin!

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:18.270
That was a pretty good 
jump you had there.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:21.660
Nah, your jump was just plain amazing.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:24.830
You jump and wave your 
tail around, get fish...

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.620
Pretty nice life there.

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:31.330
Hey, Muromi-san, did you 
come to watch our show?

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:33.750
Of course not!

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.760
Anyone can do what you're doing!

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:35.610
<b>You...</b>

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:36.650
<b>You hit me?</b>

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:41.590
I don't even know whether or 
not I'll have food tomorrow,

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:43.220
and you guys with those lungs

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.140
get to sit around in these 
nice warm vats of water!

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:49.700
Yeah, but we've been training here

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.040
as long as we can remember.

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.690
Don't fight with her.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:58.030
Muromi-san just hates 
aquatic mammals like us.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:00.320
Really? Why?

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:03.240
She doesn't like that our 
ancestors developed lungs

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:06.890
and decided to return to life in the sea.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:09.210
What? That's pathetic.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:13.170
You guys have always been so 
spiteful without realizing it!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.750
I'm pissed now!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.960
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.220
Don't go in there without permission!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.640
Dolphins are very sensitive creatures!

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.140
Cosplay?

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.940
Sensitive?!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.550
They're nothing but profit-driven mammals.

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:37.080
How are they sensitive?!

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.790
It pisses me off that 
they get their food

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.600
That's pretty mean.

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:39.190
<b>What?</b>

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:40.320
<b>Food?</b>

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.320
We're working pretty hard here, you know.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.320
by sucking up to humans!

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.520
You've been like that since forever!

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:46.030
I don't understand how 
you guys work at all.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.370
And that one guy wasn't any different.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:48.780
<b>Two hundred million years ago</b>

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.210
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.000
<i>Just a little further to the life on land</i>

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.670
<i>you've been dreaming of!</i>

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.540
<i>I'm tired. I can't do this anymore.</i>

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.090
<i>I think I'm fine in the water.</i>

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:02.470
<i>But you're able to breath air now.</i>

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:02.130
<i>Just no. I was born in the 
sea, raised in the sea,</i>

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.590
<i>and most of my friends swim.</i>

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.640
<i>You can't give up now.</i>

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:05.840
<i>Damn it, shut up!</i>

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:09.350
<i>Just leave me alone.</i>

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.890
<i>You're so annoying.</i>

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.640
<i>Stop being so needy.</i>

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.360
<i>I'm tired. Really tired.</i>

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.320
<i>Hey there, fly guy.</i>

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.940
<i>What'cha up to?</i>

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.360
<i>Huh? Oh, shit!</i>

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.280
<i>No way! You're freaking hot!</i>

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.370
<i>So who's that girl?</i>

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.660
<i>I don't know. One of my 
stalkers or something?</i>

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.520
I'm disappointed that I ever 
fell for a guy like him,

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.960
even if it was just for a second!

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:44.360
And just thinking about how easy 
you guys, his descendants, have it,

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:42.550
<b>What does that have to do with us?</b>

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.670
<b>Yeah...</b>

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.380
pisses me off so much!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:47.780
Calm down, please!

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.200
I'll have to call the police!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.600
Shut up!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.020
So her ex-boyfriend is our ancestor?

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.520
I'm not coming back here again!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.600
<b>She's still thinking about him
 after that many years?</b>

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.850
Damn you, toothed whale!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:54.850
<b>Seriously...</b>

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:54.890
She really is pathetic.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.880
<b>Damn toothed whales!!</b>

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:57.550
Muromi-san!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:03.610
All of you gather around!

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:06.720
I want to introduce 
you to someone today.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:07.820
<b>Who is it?</b>

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:07.820
<b>{]fad(188,180)}Who? Who?</b>

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:11.080
It's Hii-chan's sister, Muromi-oneetan!

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:14.400
I don't remember becoming 
your sister at any point.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.580
Oneetan is oneetan.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.210
I came because you told me you had

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.250
friends to introduce me to,

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.550
and here you are with these 
cursed toothed whales!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.440
Dolphins are cute!

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.340
What don't you like about them, Oneetan?

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:30.680
Everything!

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:33.140
She said everything!

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:36.560
Come on, how long are you 
going to dwell in the past?!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.480
<b>What's wrong? 
What's wrong?</b>

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:37.850
Shut up!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.190
<b>What's up? 
What's up?</b>

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.480
I guess you're just not 
adult enough to understand!

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.320
Muromi-san, Muromi-san!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.360
Let's play!

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.030
Ow! Ow!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.160
Dolphin-san!

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.440
You guys are so loud.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.200
This is bad! All of your bones 
from your lumbar vertebrae

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:51.490
None of you should even 
be calling me sister.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.490
to your tail fin have been destroyed!

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.040
Why? Why?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:56.080
Did we do something to make you hate us?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:01.340
Well, it's not like you guys 
directly did anything wrong.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:09.090
I know in my head, but my heart 
just won't let this happen.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.560
This is a good chance!

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.430
I want you to start liking dolphins!

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.680
And why am I so pathetic that I 
need some sort of rehabilitation?

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:19.100
Once you can handle dolphins, 
you can move on to whales!

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:25.990
See, he likes you too, Oneetan.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.940
<b>Hi! Hi!</b>

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.530
<b>I like you, Muromi-san!</b>

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:29.950
Come on, come on!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.410
<b>Come on! Come on!</b>

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:32.870
Cute, huh?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.330
<b>Come on! Come on!</b>

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:35.330
Try petting him.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.630
<i>I'm going to take over the land next.</i>

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.630
<i>The sea's like my backyard, ya know?</i>

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.720
<i>I'll become a creature where 
having lungs won't even matter.</i>

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.180
<i>That sounds like fun.</i>

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.310
This is not happening!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:57.680
<b>She slugged me...</b>

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.390
She slugged me.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.430
<b>We're dolphins, 
not slugs, though.</b>

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.810
<b>The whole Delphinidae 
family should die out!</b>

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:02.230
The whole Delphinidae 
family should die out!

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.270
This might be worse than I thought.

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:05.840
In this case...

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:13.150
So you see, I want you to help me 
cure Oneetan's hatred of dolphins.

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:16.910
You're the human who knows 
her the best, right?

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:28.010
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.660
First of all, who are you?

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:35.980
Hii-chan's name is Hii-chan.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:38.060
I'm Muromi-oneetan's little sister.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.270
I didn't know Muromi-san had a sister—

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.810
Houndfish attack!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:44.940
<b>Houndfish</b>

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:44.940
Yikes!

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:53.480
That was mean...

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.330
She's your sister, isn't she?

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.510
She's not my sister.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:58.250
She just grew up in the 
same neighborhood as me.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.330
Really?

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.150
Hii-chan, could you mind 
your own business?

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:03.530
Just leave me alone!

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:07.460
But I want you to like aquatic mammals!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:09.800
It's not going to happen!

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.840
It's already become a 
physiological issue for me!

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.160
You're just throwing away 
all of your hard work!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.200
Are you really going to keep 
running away like this?

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.930
What is even going on here?

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.310
Muromi-san!

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.320
Hii-chan!

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.150
Do you like swimming with 
the whales, Hii-chan?

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:37.870
Yeah, it's fun swimming with 
my other friends in the sea,

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.200
but swimming with whales and 
dolphins is the funnest!

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:46.420
Yeah, being with the people 
you like is the most fun of all.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:52.260
I like Oneetan as well, so I 
want to swim with Oneetan too,

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:54.590
but she doesn't come even if I invite her.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:58.200
Muromi doesn't like aquatic mammals, right?

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.060
She says that they're little 
devils when they speak,

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:04.270
and that they're cocky for having lungs.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.770
Her broken heart from the 
Mesozoic period, huh?

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:12.730
It's almost like the salt water's 
gotten into her wounds and made it worse.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.580
In that case...

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.660
I know what we're doing tonight!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.420
We're getting Muromi to cross the line!

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.580
Yay!

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:24.150
What's all this noise about?

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:32.500
Hey, it's Sumida.
We're having a mixer with some pretty
cool dudes near the 
Caribbean. Wanna come?
You'd better be there.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.170
I'm here because Sumida-san
 said she wanted me

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:27.670
to help even out the 
numbers for a mixer, but...

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.240
This is a chance for you 
to overcome the past

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.580
and broaden your horizons.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:33.310
Hey, hey!

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.630
So we have a bunch of 
questions for you, Muromi!

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.590
What do you think about lungfish?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.300
<b>Lungfish:  Protopterus</b>

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.300
<b>It's a fish, but it breathes with lungs.</b>

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:39.120
Traitors.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.640
This might go deeper than I thought.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.720
They're not even related to whales at all.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.810
Anyone who gives up on
 evolving to live on land

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:53.030
and doesn't return to breathing 
with gills should die.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:55.270
Don't say bad things about the whales!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.610
I'm pretty sure that toothed whales

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.030
See you.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:01.280
returned to the sea from 
being complete land mammals.

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:00.450
Bye bye!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.280
Huh? No way!

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.050
It's true.

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:07.280
Actually, I thought they were 
pretty smart for so quickly

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:10.380
Fifty million years
 passed during this time.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.830
<b>Basilosaurus</b>

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:10.380
<b>Cetotherium      Squalodon</b>

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:10.380
determining that they didn't have 
any means of surviving on land.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:15.810
Then what about the guy who stopped 
his evolution towards living on land?

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:19.840
He either evolved into something 
else, or died out a long time ago.

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:23.100
I've never heard of anything evolving 
from a fish into a mammal.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.970
That's why I always tell you, 
if you judge a guy

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:27.180
on just his looks, 
it's not going to go well.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:32.310
Anyway, your hatred of whales 
and dolphins is misplaced.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.240
Yeah, Oneetan.

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:37.140
They're all really nice.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:40.020
They wouldn't do anything to hurt you.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:47.710
Oneetan!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.090
What's wrong?!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.790
She realized all the hate 
she's been carrying

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.290
all these years was just 
a big misunderstanding.

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.920
And her heart couldn't take it, I bet.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:05.760
Maybe Oneetan won't hate 
aquatic mammals anymore.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:06.850
We'll see.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:11.060
Given her personality, I don't think 
she'll be able to switch right away.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:15.310
Well, in any event, Muromi's still a kid.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:19.900
I'm sorry...

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:24.200
Just let me stay like this for a while, 
and don't ask me anything.

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:33.880
After that, Muromi-san's hatred 
of aquatic mammals...

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.050
That hurt!

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:38.130
Watch where you're swimming!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.250
You're a waste of space 
and eat too much!

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.130
What's with this girl?

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.720
And you, whitey over there,

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.180
She's a punk

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.860
I bet you're full of mercury!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:50.100
...ended up with her just 
yelling at them for no reason.

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:51.580
It's Hii-chan.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:54.730
Did you know? The difference between 
dolphins and whales is just their size!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.740
Sumida here!

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:57.340
I know. Everyone knows that.

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:58.020
Then how about this?

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:00.120
Did you know that dolphins can 
communicate via telepathy?

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:01.150
Yeah, I knew that!

00:12:00.240 --> 00:13:37.020
Next time: 
"Muromi-san and the Food Chain"

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:01.950
They can fly in the sky, too!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:02.660
I knew that!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.700
They can fire beams 
from their eyes, too!

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:04.990
Already knew that!
